    <script type="application/ld+json">{"mainEntity":{"headline":"Do country risk, financial development, and informal economy improve environmental quality? Evidence from Pakistan","description":"Pakistan is currently facing severe environmental challenges, higher country risk (political, economic, and financial), and an increase in the size of its shadow economy. Financial development can be used to reduce shadow economic activities and environmental degradation. However, the country’s risk restricts the efforts to reduce environmental degradation and promote financial development. This motivates us to examine the nexus between country risk and CO2 emissions. Therefore, this study explores the impact of financial development, shadow economy and country risk on environmental degradation in Pakistan, using data from 1990 to 2020. The study utilizes the conventional ADF, Fourier GLS/ADF unit root test, RALS-FARDL, and Bayer & Hanck (2013) cointegration test. The study utilizes FMOLS, DOLS and CCR to estimate long-run relationships, and the findings indicate that country risk intensifies carbon emissions. It is also found that financial development and economic growth are positively related to carbon emissions, while the shadow economy is negatively related. Moreover, employing the single-frequency Toda & Yamamoto causality test, the study examines the bidirectional causality between carbon emissions and country risk. This study recommends the adoption of environmentally friendly technologies financed by the banking sector to lessen environmental pollution, which is important for sustainable development.","datePublished":"2026-09-16T00:00:00Z","dateModified":"2026-09-16T00:00:00Z","pageStart":"1","pageEnd":"29","sameAs":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s40822-026-00386-7","keywords":["Country risk","Shadow economy","Financial development","Carbon emission","Fourier approach","Economics","general"],"image":[],"isPartOf":{"name":"Eurasian Economic Review","issn":["2147-429X","1309-422X"],"@type":["Periodical"]},"publisher":{"name":"Springer International Publishing","logo":{"url":"https://www.springernature.com/app-sn/public/images/logo-springernature.png","@type":"ImageObject"},"@type":"Organization"},"author":[{"name":"Faisal Faisal","affiliation":[{"name":"Sohar University","address":{"name":"Faculty of Business, Sohar University, Sohar, Oman","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"},{"name":"Altinbas Cyprus University","address":{"name":"Altinbas Cyprus University, Mersin, Türkiye","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"},{"name":"Abdul Wali Khan university","address":{"name":"Department of Accounting and Finance, Institute of Business Studies and Leadership, Faculty of Business and Economics, Abdul Wali Khan university, Mardan, Pakistan","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Hamid Ghazi H Sulimany","affiliation":[{"name":"Taif University","address":{"name":"Faculty of Business Administration College, Accounting Department, Taif University, Taif, Saudi Arabia","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Sami Ur Rahman","affiliation":[{"name":"Birmingham City University","address":{"name":"Department of Accounting, Finance and Economics, Birmingham City University, Birmingham, UK","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Adnan Ali","affiliation":[{"name":"Sohar University","address":{"name":"Faculty of Business, Sohar University, Sohar, Oman","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"},{"name":"Shaheed Benazir Bhutto University Sheringal Dir (U)","address":{"name":"Department of Management Sciences, Shaheed Benazir Bhutto University Sheringal Dir (U), Dir, Pakistan","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Aliya Zhakanova","affiliation":[{"name":"Near East University","address":{"name":"Near East University, Nicosia, Türkiye","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"email":"aliya.isiksal@neu.edu.tr","@type":"Person"}],"isAccessibleForFree":false,"hasPart":{"isAccessibleForFree":false,"cssSelector":".main-content","@type":"WebPageElement"},"@type":"ScholarlyArticle"},"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage"}</script>

        
        
